  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the pork belly into sliced
  - Chop the green chillies sliced
  - Chop the bird's eye chillies sliced
  - Chop the garlic into sliced
  - Chop the onion into sliced
  - Chop the ginger into sliced
  - Turn the stove to medium heat.
  - Put the pan in the stove.
  - Add the chop pork belly
  - Saute and render the fat
  - Add the choped garlic
  - Add the choped onion
  - Add the choped ginger
  - Saute until brown
  - Add the bagoong alamang
  - Pour the water
  - Pour the coconut milk
  - Put coconut cream
  - Add the green chillies
  - "Add the bird\u2019s eye chillies"
  - Add 1 tsp of fish sauce(Manila linage)
  - Add 1 tsp of sugar(Manila linage)
  - Mix it using the spatula
  - Add 1 tbsp of pepper
  - Put the pan lid to simmer
